ull,"start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"gongsuntao-q-6bd828e92dd27a70b9b3","section":"chapter-008","block":"b-c43038671a6cb4b7444f","layer":"original","quote":"绣至，太祖执其手，与欢宴；为子均取绣女，拜扬武将军","section_title":"二公孙陶四张传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0021.xhtml","index":255,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":27,"end":52,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o067a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-dc1a245c11b19ab82338","layer":"original","quote":"冬十一月，张绣率众降，封列侯。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":364,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":15,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-51bced16741add42ff70","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-51bced16741add42ff70","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗四年：建安四年（公元 199）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":369,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-20628d34a709162c77f0","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o061","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-502d4e8c0ed143eaa30d","layer":"original","quote":"四年春二月〖1〗，公还至昌邑〖2〗。张杨将杨丑杀杨〖3〗。眭固又杀丑，以其众属袁绍，屯射犬〖4〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":358,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-a51101f6a762553225ed","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-ed510bde2afb6e18cf9d","layer":"original","quote":"二十四年薨〖6〗。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":187,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":25,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-c2f55f326342aebf012b","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-87027621c423a4f13bd6","layer":"original","quote":"武皇帝二十五男：卞皇后生文皇帝、任城威王彰、陈思王植、萧怀王熊；刘夫人生丰愍王昂、相殇王铄；环夫人生邓哀王冲、彭城王据、燕王宇；杜夫人生沛穆王林、中山恭王衮；秦夫人生济阳怀王玹、陈留恭王峻；尹夫人生范阳闵王矩；王昭仪生赵王幹；孙姬生临邑殇公子上、楚王彪、刚殇公子勤；李姬生谷城殇公子乘、郿戴公子整、灵殇公子京；周姬生樊安公均；刘姬生广宗殇公子棘；宋姬生东平灵王徽；赵姬生乐陵王茂。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":190,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-e0d04468800c86093160","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-ed510bde2afb6e18cf9d","layer":"original","quote":"黄初二年，追进公爵，谥曰安公。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":187,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":38,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-ef9b4b73134a8249593c","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-ed510bde2afb6e18cf9d","layer":"original","quote":"建安二十二年，封樊侯。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":187,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuwen-q-f40488ec01be07a2a4ed","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-ed510bde2afb6e18cf9d","layer":"original","quote":"樊安公均，奉叔父蓟恭公彬后。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":187,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":14,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
